            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument falls under the category of Contributing Property in the USA where it is situated. The exact location of the monument is in Adams County, Pennsylvania, in the municipality of Gettysburg and the monument was built in the year 2000. To the southeast of Adams County, Pennsylvania lies Carroll County, Maryland."
